{
    "title": "WSB-TV News",
    "description": "Channel 2 Action News App delivers coverage you can count on in North Georgia. Explore important local stories that impact you and your community with 24/7 coverage from the major news of the day to local investigations, on-demand videos, and live newscast stream.\r\n\r\nThe Channel 2 Action News App is your guide to:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tImportant  local stories from Cobb, Fulton, Dekalb, Gwinnett, Clayton, Cherokee,  Barrow, Bartow, Carroll, Douglas, Fayette, Forsyth, Hall, Henry, Coweta, Spalding, Newton, Paulding, Rockdale, and Walton counties.\r\n\u2022\tGetting where you need to go on time with live drive times in and out of the Atlanta Metro Area.\r\n\u2022\tTracking storms minute-by-minute with StormTracker 2 HD radar and 24/7 access to the 5-day forecast so you know how the weather will impact your day. \r\n\u2022\tLocal sports coverage of the Atlanta Falcons, Atlanta Braves, Atlanta Hawks, Atlanta United, and more. \r\n\u2022\tThe latest national and world news and how it impacts Georgia. \r\n\u2022\tEngaging content that you can share easily from the app to Twitter and Facebook.\r\n\r\nGet accessible coverage that keeps you up-to-date with WSB-TV Channel 2 News. \r\n\r\nContinued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life. Please note: This app features Nielsen's proprietary measurement software, which will allow you to contribute to market research like Nielsen's TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Channel 2 Action News App delivers coverage you can count on in North Georgia. Explore important local stories that impact you and your community with 24/7 coverage from the major news of the day to local investigations, on-demand videos, and live newscast stream.<br><br>The Channel 2 Action News App is your guide to:<br><br>\u2022\tImportant  local stories from Cobb, Fulton, Dekalb, Gwinnett, Clayton, Cherokee,  Barrow, Bartow, Carroll, Douglas, Fayette, Forsyth, Hall, Henry, Coweta, Spalding, Newton, Paulding, Rockdale, and Walton counties.<br>\u2022\tGetting where you need to go on time with live drive times in and out of the Atlanta Metro Area.<br>\u2022\tTracking storms minute-by-minute with StormTracker 2 HD radar and 24/7 access to the 5-day forecast so you know how the weather will impact your day. <br>\u2022\tLocal sports coverage of the Atlanta Falcons, Atlanta Braves, Atlanta Hawks, Atlanta United, and more. <br>\u2022\tThe latest national and world news and how it impacts Georgia. <br>\u2022\tEngaging content that you can share easily from the app to Twitter and Facebook.<br><br>Get accessible coverage that keeps you up-to-date with WSB-TV Channel 2 News. <br><br>Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life. Please note: This app features Nielsen&#39;s proprietary measurement software, which will allow you to contribute to market research like Nielsen&#39;s TV Ratings. Please see www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.",
